# DsAvatar docs snippets

## Default

### Show code
<DsAvatar name="John Doe" />

### MCP manifest
const Default = () => <DsAvatar name="John Doe" />;

## With Image

### Show code
<DsAvatar
  alt="Jane Smith"
  name="Jane Smith"
  src="https://i.pravatar.cc/150?u=jane"
/>

### MCP manifest
const WithImage = () => <DsAvatar name="Jane Smith" src="https://i.pravatar.cc/150?u=jane" alt="Jane Smith" />;

## Image Fallback

### Show code
<DsAvatar
  name="Ada Lovelace"
  src="https://invalid.example/missing.png"
/>

### MCP manifest
const ImageFallback = () => <DsAvatar name="Ada Lovelace" src="https://invalid.example/missing.png" />;

## Rounded

### Show code
<DsAvatar
  name="Rose Oliver"
  type="rounded"
/>

### MCP manifest
const Rounded = () => <DsAvatar name="Rose Oliver" type="rounded" />;